.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt RAVEN-STATUS 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm raven-status
.Nd show RavenBSD host health
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
collects one status snapshot from the running services and prints it as human text or, with
.Fl -json ,
as one object of
.Va kind :
.Dq status .
The fields are the contract in
.Pa architecture/17-modern-userland.md
section 3.4: version, target, uptime, boot id, service counts, load, memory, root mount, links
and log counters.
A value the backend cannot supply is
.Dv null ,
never a fabricated zero.
.Pp
The command exits 0 when every core service is running and ready and 1 otherwise.
If the status backend is unreachable it reports the error and prints no status object.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr raven 1 ,
.Xr raven-doctor 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD modern userland contract, revision 1.
